			"notes": "## ADDITIONS\n* Added soyuz rocket and its platform\n* Added anti-ballistic missile\n* Added large launch pad\n* Added the blue rinse nuke\n* Added assembly machine\n* Added some building blocks\n* Added volcanoes\n* Added barbed wires\n* Added spikes\n* Added bobbleheads\n\n## CHANGES\n* Nuclear explosions will now use \"Threaded DDA raytracer\"\n  * This means explosions will destroy blocks much faster\n* Fire, balefire, phosphorus and blackfire player properties now will affect player\n* Updated fat mine model and texture\n\n## FIXES\n* Explosion algorithm now try to clear water at chunk borders\n* Fixed server side loading client classes\n* Fixed nuke mushroom cloud not rendering after explosion in sable sublevel\n* Fixed obj model renderer breaking with veil installed\n* Fixed obj model loader crashing the game\n* Fixed vanilla armor not reducing damage"
