			"notes": "## ADDITIONS\n* Added Self-charging batteries\n* Added Normal, dual, quad rods\n* Added OBJ model reloader\n* Added Prototype nuke\n* Added nuke kits\n* Added some ingots (placeholder)\n\n## CHANGES\n* Changed version naming\n  * Now its gonna be (days since 1/1/2026)(build type: A - Alpha, B - beta, etc) e.g 125A\n* Improved obj model renderer optimization A LOT\n  * But render breaks when using Iris\n  * And its breaks when using Create Aeronautics...\n* Crater biomes now will have grass noise\n* Revamped fölkvanger field\n* Calculator now will have history\n* Updated the fat man igniter and gadget wiring icons\n\n## FIXES\n* Fixed fensu's lights shading\n* Fixed particles being black on linux\n* Fixed 256k tank, fensu, battery socket and nukes cull bounding box"
