			"notes": "## Added\n* F.L.E.I.J.A nuke, Balefire nuke\n* Tier 0 missiles\n* Fluid ducts\n* ANY vanilla explosion now create cloud and smoke particles\n  * For some reason this effect was in the old versions of minecraft but not in 1.21.1\n  * Check this video for showcase https://www.reddit.com/r/Minecraft/comments/1mp049m/after_6_years_mojang_has_finally_fixed_the/\n\n## Changed\n* Some collisions\n* Ivy mike and tsar bomba now will use explosive lenses instead of EARLY explosive lenses\n  * Also changed texture of the explosive lenses\n* Improved gibbing\n  * Iron golems now also turn into metal instead of fleshy chunks\n  * Slimes can now be gibbed, turning into slime globs\n  * Creepers now also gib into slime instead of blood\n* Item renderer translations\n* Updated textures for some nuclear bomb GUIs\n\n## Fixed\n* Lightning issues in multiblocks\n* Spectator now can access multiblock's menu from any part\n* 256k fluid tank's render crashing on clients without iris\n* Multi detonator missing name and description\n* Some explosive block not being ignited by redstone on place"
